            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.2.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 2:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Gambira Abaisraeli oti: Omukazi ku arigira enda, yaazaara omwana w'omwojo, aryamara ebiro mushanju atashemeire; nk'oku aba ari omubiro bye by'okuza omu kwezi, nikwo ariguma ari otashemeire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.2.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 2:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aha kiro kya munaana omwana ogwo aryasharwa ekishushu ky'omubiri gwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nyina aryagumizamu ari omu shagama y'ekizaire, amare ebiro makumi ashatu na bishatu naashemezibwa; atarikora aha kintu kyona ekyeziibwe, n'obu kwakuba okuza omu Mwanya ogurikwera ebiro by'okutashemera kwe bitakahweire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka ku arizaara omwishiki, obwo aryamara ebiro ikumi na bina ari otashemeire nk'omu biro bye by'okuza omu kwezi; agumizemu ari omu shagama y'ekizaire, amare ebiro makumi mukaaga na mukaaga, naashemezibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebiro by'okutashemera kwe ku birihwa, yaaba by'omwojo nari eby'omwishiki, aryareeta omwana gw'entaama oguhikize omwaka kuba ekitambo ky'okwotsya, n'enkombe nto nari akaiba kuba empongano y'ekibi, abireetere omunyamurwa aha muryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omunyamurwa abihongyere omu maisho ga MUKAMA, amurihiirire; ogwo mukazi abone kushemezibwa omu by'eshagama y'obuzaire bwe. Ekyo nikyo kiragiro ky'omukazi ozaire omwana w'omwojo nari ow'omwishiki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.2.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 2:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.8.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kor 8:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka ku ariba ari omworo, atarikubaasa kureeta mwana gw'entaama, areete obwiba bubiri nari enkombe nto ibiri, emwe kuba ey'ekitambo ky'okwotsya, n'endiijo kuba ey'empongano y'ekibi; omunyamurwa amurihiirire, abe oshemeziibwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
